3}}{v}_{2}-\\frac{{x}_{4}}{{x}_{3}}{v}_{4}.\n$$\n\nThis means that ${v}_{3}$ is a linear combination of ${v}_{1}$, ${v}_{2},$ and ${v}_{4}.$\n\n- Statement II is false. Since ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{4}}$ is a linearly independent set, ${v}_{4}$ can not be a linear combination of other vectors.\n\n- Statement III is false. Since ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{4}}$ is a linearly independent set, ${v}_{2}$ can not be a linear combination of other vectors.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304644 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304645 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304646 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304647 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1000 #edb/ref 17592186304648 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1041 "selection" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1104 #edb/ref 17592186304646 13194139534707 true] [17592186304643 1110 #uuid "513b033e-149b-5a7e-8359-55954d43877c" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304644 1034 "I, II, and III" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304644 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534707 true] [17592186304644 1111 #uuid "777606d2-bc9f-516f-8ae7-6c8ac8942b0f" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304645 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304645 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534707 true] [17592186304645 1111 #uuid "1ac57f25-04fe-5934-a6b1-6f5ff579602c" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304646 1034 "I only" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304646 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534707 true] [17592186304646 1111 #uuid "ef725f95-ad09-5f9e-828c-0ca0d703b32b" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304647 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304647 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534707 true] [17592186304647 1111 #uuid "70715f03-c2c3-59a9-9576-02180830de9d" 13194139534707 true] [17592186304648 1034 "II only" 13194139